<div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Winter in Los Cabos is the season of life, music and tradition. It is the perfect time for those looking for a meaningful experience.</span></p>
<ol>
<li>
<h3><b> Los Cabos International Film Festival (December)</b></h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The destination dresses up for the occasion. This event combines glamour with the tropical atmosphere of Cabo San Lucas. Enjoy red carpets, exclusive premieres and social events at luxury oceanfront hotels.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Enjoy the Glamour: It is the perfect blend of film, style and beach.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After a night of elegance, balance things out with an adrenaline rush on our high-altitude Sky Bike tour, the only activity in Los Cabos with a Guinness World Record.</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li>
<h3><b> San José Jazz Weekend (February)</b></h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The historic downtown of San José del Cabo becomes a bohemian open-air music venue. Local and international musicians fill the streets with jazz, funk and soul.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Enjoy the Atmosphere: An intimate evening that combines music, art and food.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Ideal for a relaxed stroll after a day of action on our UTV trails.</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li>
<h3><b> Traditional Festivities of San José del Cabo (March)</b></h3>
</li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A vibrant display of tradition and color. The colonial streets come alive with parades, folk dances and delicious food. It is a chance to experience authentic Mexico beyond the beach.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Enjoy the Tradition: The cultural essence of Baja California Sur will captivate you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">At Cactus: If you enjoy the authenticity of its traditions, you will love the exclusivity of our horseback riding activities.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
